       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Good day, Seeker.",
         "transl": "Добридень, Шукачко."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "forest.family-mother",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Did you find time to talk to my mother?",
         "transl": "Вам вдалося поговорити з моєю матір'ю?"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "forest.family-mother",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "[nods]",
         "transl": "[киває]"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "NOD"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "She was not always like this. ",
         "transl": "Вона не завжди була такою."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "forest.family-mother",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "When my younger brother disappeared into the depths of the bamboo thickets, she became that way...\\.\\.\\. over time.",
         "transl": "Коли мій молодший брат зник у бамбукових хащах, вона з часом...\\.\\.\\. змінилася."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "forest.family-mother",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Why?",
         "transl": "Чому?"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "NERVOUS"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "She never gave up the search and after a while... she started talking in riddles.",
         "transl": "Вона не полишала пошуків, а згодом... почала говорити загадками."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "forest.family-mother",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "At one point she even claimed my brother returned as \"the protector of the ridge\". ",
         "transl": "Одного разу вона навіть сказала, що мій брат повернувся як \"захисник хребта\"."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "forest.family-mother",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "I think this loss was just too hard on her.",
         "transl": "Гадаю, вона просто не змогла пережити цю втрату."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "forest.family-mother",
